.opencode/

# Claude Code. Everything under .claude/ is per-machine or per-session state by
# default — settings.local.json, agent worktrees, handoff scratch — so ignore the
# directory and allowlist back only the config that is genuinely shared: the
# committed settings, the hooks those settings register, and repo-scoped
# skills/agents/commands/plugins.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json
!/.claude/hooks/
!/.claude/skills/
!/.claude/agents/
!/.claude/commands/
!/.claude/plugins/

# ...but never a .local. variant, wherever it sits. Those are per-machine
# overrides by convention, including inside an otherwise-tracked skill.
/.claude/**/*.local.*
